      "statement": "ZeroHubClient.disconnect() sets isDisconnected, clears pending ICE timeouts, detaches all WebSocket handlers (so onclose does not auto-reconnect) and closes the socket with code 1000, then transitions every peer to Disconnected, closes each RTCPeerConnection, and empties the peers map; the client is reusable afterwards.",
